WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.129
A firm that makes cloth: raw material in, finished goods out, machines that depreciate.

2
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:22.439
A person, an HUF, a partnership firm, an LLP, an AOP or BOI, or a company - each card starts its own filing. A trust says Not yet, with what to do meanwhile.

3
00:00:23.046 --> 00:00:32.216
Manufacturing, GST, a tax audit, stock and inventory, machines - the documents list follows from them.

4
00:00:32.827 --> 00:00:47.847
The form follows from the picks, with its reason in one line - ITR-1, 2, 3 or 4 for a person or an HUF, ITR-5 for a firm, an LLP or an AOP, ITR-6 for a company.

5
00:00:48.468 --> 00:01:02.768
Needed, good to have, and what you type in - each with what it is and where to get it: TRACES, the AIS, your employer, CAMS or KFintech, the GST portal, the firm's deed and its books.

6
00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:10.420
The GST certificate names a firm already in the register - the documents go to its return.

7
00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:19.600
Lakshmi Narayana Textiles is found by its PAN. Its partners come from the deed, confirmed in the popup.

8
00:01:20.218 --> 00:01:28.278
The manufacturing account goes to Intake & map. Closing stock and the depreciation schedule are tagged there.

9
00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:38.540
This year's filing, which waited in Collecting, now has its books, 26AS and GST returns - on to the Tax audit.
